====== Western Digital My Net N750 ======
Dual Band (concurrent) and 5-Port Gigabit Ethernet (4 LAN / 1 WAN).
Advertised as 750 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 GHz Band and Triple-Stream (3x3) on the 5 GHz Band.
Western Digitial has [[http://community.wd.com/t5/My-Net-Networking-Devices/Did-Western-Digital-Discontinue-the-quot-My-Net-quot-line-of/td-p/673645|discontinued its line of networking products]].

  * Manufacturer Link: [[https://support.wdc.com/product.aspx?ID=1702]]
  * GPL Source code: [[https://support.wdc.com/downloads.aspx?p=178]]


